{"slug":"service","title":"售后与服务支持","sections":[{"id":"4ad06522-5fe9-4227-824b-e09f844d0406","type":"TEXT_IMAGE","content":{"body":"","heading":"售后政策","bodyHtml":"<p>如今，客户满意度是IG 公司的主旨。为了确保我们在这个领域的效率，我们提供了一个多服务的售后服务部门。</p><p>维修服务：根据客户需求进行维修和/或标准更换</p><p>客户培训，以优化分析仪的使用</p><p>备件：库存易耗件</p><p>我们的分析仪调试和现场员工培训</p><p>按需提供紧急维修服务</p><p>定期访问维护合同，提供不同类型的合同</p><p>我们的外国代理商定期接受我们全系列产品的培训。</p>","sourceNotes":[{"title":"售后政策","pending":true,"bodyHtml":"<p>位于江苏省.苏州市的售后服务中心</p><p>技术支持：我们的服务工程师承诺在24小时内通过电话或电子邮件回复您的问题</p><p>服务工程师团队覆盖德国（必要时覆盖世界各地），以确保</p>","sourceUrl":"http://www.igenu.com/cn/AFTER.html","capturedAt":"2026-10-21T04:13:22.254Z"}],"imagePosition":"right"},"media":{"id":"d3e2e0bf-fc98-4a22-9168-db57e6e95770","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"banner2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":156061,"sha256":"bf2e04a4abd73a498193b401022db731baba02809ff40e8fe8bd9941403c65be","width":1200,"height":334,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/bf2e04a4abd73a498193b401.jpg","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.538Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":89,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/4194935bea57b6acc00f076e.webp"},{"width":640,"height":178,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/f624da608982a3225f43d227.webp"},{"width":960,"height":267,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/85eff24a5e704ee762de52e4.webp"},{"width":1200,"height":334,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/8b18a9e61d8ab43663cb4651.webp"}]},"mediaItems":[{"id":"d3e2e0bf-fc98-4a22-9168-db57e6e95770","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"banner2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":156061,"sha256":"bf2e04a4abd73a498193b401022db731baba02809ff40e8fe8bd9941403c65be","width":1200,"height":334,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/bf2e04a4abd73a498193b401.jpg","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.538Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":89,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/4194935bea57b6acc00f076e.webp"},{"width":640,"height":178,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/f624da608982a322